@using Economy.Domain.Entites.TenantEntity.EntityAppLanguages
@using Economy.Panel.UI.Areas.Tenant.Models.AppPageViewModels
@model PageBlockVm
@{
    ViewBag.Title = $"Edit Block #{Model.Id}";
    var langs = (List<AppLanguage>)ViewBag.Languages;
    var info = (dynamic)ViewBag.PageInfo;
}
<main>
    <div class="container-fluid">
@await Html.PartialAsync("_breadcrumbs")

<h3>@ViewBag.Title</h3>
<div class="alert alert-light">PageId: @info.PageId | Slug: @info.Slug </div>

<form method="post">
    @Html.AntiForgeryToken()
    <div class="card">
        <div class="card-header d-flex gap-3 align-items-center">
            <div><strong>Type:</strong> @Model.Type</div>
            <div class="form-check"><input class="form-check-input" asp-for="IsActive" /> <label class="form-check-label">Active</label></div>
            <select class="form-select form-select-sm" asp-for="Stage" style="width:130px">
                <option value="0">Draft</option>
                <option value="1">Published</option>
                <option value="2">Archived</option>
            </select>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
            <div class="row g-3">
                <div class="col-md-2">
                    <label class="form-label">Sort</label>
                    <input class="form-control" asp-for="SortOrder" />
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-3">
                    <label class="form-label">LibraryBlockId</label>
                    <input class="form-control" asp-for="LibraryBlockId" />
                    <div class="form-check mt-1">
                        <input class="form-check-input" asp-for="IsLinkedToLibrary" />
                        <label class="form-check-label">Linked</label>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-12">
                    <label class="form-label">Shared JSON</label>
                    <textarea class="form-control" asp-for="SharedJson" rows="8"></textarea>
                </div>
            </div>
            <hr />
            <h6>Localized</h6>
            <div class="row g-3">
                @for (int i = 0; i < Model.Translations.Count; i++)
                {
                    var lid = Model.Translations[i].LanguageId;
                    var ln = langs.First(x => x.Id == lid);
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="card">
                            <div class="card-header"><strong>@ln.Name (@ln.Code.ToUpper())</strong></div>
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <input type="hidden" asp-for="Translations[i].Id" />
                                <input type="hidden" asp-for="Translations[i].LanguageId" />
                                <textarea class="form-control" asp-for="Translations[i].LocalizedJson" rows="6"></textarea>
                                <div class="mt-2">
                                    <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" href='@Url.Action("EditPageBlock", "BlockEditor", new { area = "Tenant", pageBlockId = Model.Id ?? 0, languageId = lid })'>Type-specific editor</a>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                }
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-footer">
            <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Save</button>
            <a class="btn btn-outline-secondary" href="@Url.Action("Index")">Back</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</form>
</div></main>